  "title": "Hana 🌵",
  "summary": "At dawn Hana sends the true version, no excuses: she was 25, terrified for herself, and made Ben the reason. Marisol refuses to forward anything without Ben's consent and asks him first. Ben agrees to one message, and Hana's apology comes out to him in her own words. Their mother's surgery goes well. Ben asks to see Hana alone at the shop; afterwards she has 'maybe' for Christmas, and Marisol has a real date. The contact gets renamed.",
  "status": "final",
  "cliffhanger": null,
  "createdAt": "2026-10-09T20:00:00Z",
