      "title": "Not Ben ❓",
      "messages": [
        {
          "kind": "timestamp",
          "id": "t01",
          "label": "Mon, Nov 16 at 5:52 AM"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m01",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "I'm sorry I left. I sat in the car for an hour, then I drove out to Gates Pass and back."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m02",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "Here's the true version. Ben came out at dinner in March 2020. Dad said he didn't have a son. Mom cleared the plates like it was any other night."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m03",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "I walked Ben to his car. He was shaking. And I said, 'Maybe you could just not make it everyone's business.'"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m04",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "I said it because I was 25 and I'd known about myself since I was 14, and I had just watched exactly what would happen to me."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m05",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "I made him the reason I was scared. I've never said that to anyone."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "I told you we drifted because 'drifted' doesn't have a person in it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "I'm not asking you to forgive me for it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "i'm not the one who gets to forgive you"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "but thank you for the true version"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "hana",
          "text": "Will you still talk to me?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m11",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "i'm awake at 5:52 on my day off. what do you think"
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "beat": "The true version."
      }
    },
