        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "\"Ben. What I said by your car was the cruellest thing anyone said that night, because I was the one person at that table who should have understood. You didn't know why. I'm gay. I've known since I was 14.\""
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "\"I watched what happened to you and I was terrified, and I made you the reason. I'm sorry. Mom's surgery is Wednesday at 7. You don't owe anyone anything. I'd like to know you again, on whatever terms are yours. — Hana\"",
